[
  {
    "sha": "518d1af4bdbbd8d95b47a35e36cc0e1e3e487054",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVVonwNoAKDUxOGQxYWY0YmRiYmQ4ZDk1YjQ3YTM1ZTM2Y2MwZTFlM2U0ODcwNTQ",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-07T23:03:42Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-07T23:03:42Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(cli): camcraft-cli mcp, a stdio MCP server that drives a headless job\n\nAn AI agent (any MCP client) can now program a part step by step over\nJSON-RPC 2.0 on stdio, per the public MCP spec (2025-06-18; 2025-03-26 and\n2024-11-05 negotiated): initialize, ping, tools/list, tools/call.\n\nTools (17): open_project, save_project, import_model, get_job,\nlist_operation_types, list_tool_catalog, add_tool, set_stock,\nadd_operation, edit_operation, delete_operation, set_tool, undo, redo,\ngenerate, verify, post. Each has a JSON input schema; unknown arguments\nare refused.\n\n- One session is one script::Env (document + History). The load, save,\n  import, generate, verify and post verbs are the job-script host's,\n  called directly, so all three lanes share one meaning per verb.\n- Every write is a real command through the History (AddTool, SetStock,\n  CreateOperation, EditOperationParams, EditOperationLinks,\n  DeleteOperation, ImportModel, GenerateOperation), so undo/redo walk it.\n- Params use the project file's DTO shape (new project/json.rs).\n  edit_operation is a JSON merge patch over the kind's fields; a field\n  the kind lacks is refused by name.\n- verify adds structured findings: op, move index, kind, message,\n  blocks_post, plus the post gate's problems.\n- Every refusal is an MCP tool error (isError), including an unknown\n  tool. Protocol junk gets JSON-RPC errors. tools/call has a\n  catch_unwind backstop. No unwrap, expect or panic on any path.\n- serde_json only; no MCP SDK (rmcp would pull in tokio). Design is in\n  RECOMMENDED.md.\n\nPinned by tests/mcp.rs: handshake_and_tool_list,\na_whole_job_over_the_tools, bad_input_is_a_tool_error_never_a_panic,\nthe_stdio_loop_answers_line_for_line.\n\nOwed: #180 face/edge/loop picks, #181 WCS/machine/fixtures,\n#182 sim render, #183 GUI server mode.\n\nRefs #128\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
